    <string name="about_license_body">Muslim ye app ya bwereere ddala, open-source wansi wa layisinsi ya GPLv3 — tewali birango, tewali kuwandiika, tewali kulondoola. Enkyusa yonna ekyusiddwa esigala nga nzigule.</string>
    <string name="about_license_title">Layisinsi</string>
